BT 1 0 0 1 0 52.1 Tm /F1 8.9 Tf 12.2 TL (The Nassau Candy Shipping Intelligence project transforms 10,194 shipment records into an interactive) Tj T* -0.041177 Tw (business-intelligence environment. It provides a consolidated view of 38,654 units, $141,783.63 in sales and $93,442.80 in) Tj T* 0 Tw (gross profit, while exposing destination, factory, route, product and shipping-mode concentration. Its strongest) Tj T* (methodological feature is analytical transparency: validated descriptive findings are separated from date-derived metrics) Tj T* (requiring source confirmation.) Tj T* ET
